      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russellville%2C_Arkansas",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In the 1970s, the arrival of large retailers like Walmart began shifting the historic downtown, leading to many historic buildings being lost or repurposed.",
